# Optional: `npm run dev:https` still loads this file.
# Dev HTTPS is ON by default in vite.config.js (opt out with VITE_DEV_SERVER_HTTPS=false in .env).

# Web FCM — without VITE_FIREBASE_VAPID_KEY, POST /patient/register sends fcm_token as "".
# Firebase Console → your project → Project settings (gear) → Cloud Messaging → Web Push certificates.
# Click "Generate key pair" if none exists, then paste the public key into .env / .env.local (same file as other VITE_* vars):
# VITE_FIREBASE_VAPID_KEY=BGx...your_key...
